<div class="text-center mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-key fa-2x text-primary"></i></div>
<h1 class="h4 text-center mb-2">Reset your password?</h1>
<p class="text-secondary text-center mb-4">
  This link signs you in as <strong><%= user.username %></strong> so you can choose a new password.
  You will need to set it before going anywhere else.
</p>
<form method="post" action="/reset/<%= token %>">
  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
  <button class="btn btn-primary w-100" type="submit">Yes, reset my password</button>
</form>
<a class="btn btn-link w-100 mt-2" href="/login">No, back to sign in</a>
<p class="form-text text-center mt-3 mb-0">If you did not ask for this, close this page. Your password stays the same.</p>
